# Phase 9C v0.1 brands real-provider smoke desensitization
# Per 5.0 release gate pattern: no raw provider output, no generated images,
# no session/trace logs in commit. Only desensitized run.json + prompt.md +
# report.md are tracked.

# Generated images (raw provider output, can be 100s of KB - 1MB+)
**/image.png

# Smoke run logs (can contain trace/session data)
smoke-run.log
smoke-run.log.err

# Allow these to be tracked
!*.md
!run.json
!prompt.md
!*.json
